{
  "batch_id": "ai-series-20260912",
  "source_name": "小林面试笔记 AI系列",
  "scope": "2026-09-12 已提取的五专题备课内容；站内独立表述，不复制网站原文",
  "source_count": 98,
  "items": [
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-01",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 1,
      "label": "Agent与模型",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/1_whatisagent.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-001"
      ],
      "insight": "模型给出决策不等于外部行动已执行；运行时必须执行、获取反馈并核验结果。显式规划和长期记忆不是所有Agent的必要定义。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-02",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 2,
      "label": "运行组成",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/2_components.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-013"
      ],
      "insight": "模型、工具、状态、预算和结果验证分别承担责任；这些职责可以由少量函数实现，不要求一套固定模块目录。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-03",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 3,
      "label": "流程与工具",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/3_workflow_tools.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-001"
      ],
      "insight": "预定义编排仍可包含LLM路由或动态子任务；固定控制结构不意味着输出完全确定，Agent与工作流也可以嵌套。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-04",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 4,
      "label": "执行范式",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/4_patterns.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-015"
      ],
      "insight": "执行策略、规划粒度与质量复核是可组合的设计维度；用相同任务集比较，不把某模式说成唯一生产选择。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-05",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 5,
      "label": "ReAct反馈",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/5_react.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-015"
      ],
      "insight": "ReAct可以根据观察更新计划和处理异常，不是只能向前走；工具观察须来自实际执行，文字推理不是执行凭证。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-06",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 6,
      "label": "规划和反思比较",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/6_three_patterns.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-015"
      ],
      "insight": "分层模型是否省钱取决于调用次数、输入输出长度、缓存及失败重做；每轮重发不断增长的历史时，累计输入可能呈二次增长。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-07",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 7,
      "label": "任务拆分",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/7_tasksplit.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-007"
      ],
      "insight": "把子任务写成输入、产物、验收与依赖；并行只用于依赖允许的部分，拆得更细也可能增加协调和重复阅读。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-08",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 8,
      "label": "记忆职责",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/8_memory.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-005"
      ],
      "insight": "区分线程状态、当前模型输入、跨线程事实与业务状态；持久化历史不意味着模型每次都能读完。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-09",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 9,
      "label": "记忆存取",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/9_memory_storage.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-023"
      ],
      "insight": "长期记忆需要写入规则、稳定标识、权限、版本和删除机制；不是会话结束后无条件向量化一切。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-10",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 10,
      "label": "多Agent",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/10_multiagent.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-008"
      ],
      "insight": "多角色可能减少单个上下文干扰，也增加通信、预算和集成成本；单Agent同样可以并发调用独立工具。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-11",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 11,
      "label": "单多Agent选型",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/11_single_multi.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-008"
      ],
      "insight": "先验证单体瓶颈是否来自可拆分工作，再比较隔离和协作收益；不能用Agent数量代替对并发与质量的实测。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-12",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 12,
      "label": "记忆压缩",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/12_memcompress.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-031"
      ],
      "insight": "窗口、摘要和结构化状态可以组合；Prompt Cache减少重复计算，不扩大模型上下文窗口，也不保证保留关键约束。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-13",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 13,
      "label": "框架与自研",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/13_handcode.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-010"
      ],
      "insight": "比较关键路径可见性、团队维护能力和升级成本；手写并不天然稳定，框架也并非只适合演示。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-14",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 14,
      "label": "规划能力",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/14_planning.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-007"
      ],
      "insight": "任务规划还要表达动作依赖、约束和停止条件；推理提示方法不是有权限执行计划的替代品。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-15",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 15,
      "label": "反思证据",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/15_reflection.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-016"
      ],
      "insight": "同模型换一个评审角色不构成独立事实来源；用程序断言、工具结果或外部证据提供反馈，并限制迭代预算。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-16",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 16,
      "label": "协作与交接",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/16_collab.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-021"
      ],
      "insight": "交接要传递目标、允许能力、状态版本和产物契约；共享状态的合并规则需明确，不能任意并发覆盖。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-17",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 17,
      "label": "上下文装配",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/17_context_engineering.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-050"
      ],
      "insight": "按任务相关性、时效、权限和来源可信度选内容；检索到的文本是证据，不自动升级为更高优先级指令。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-18",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 18,
      "label": "会话与恢复",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/18_session_state.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-030"
      ],
      "insight": "对话、任务进度和业务副作用分别建模；合法目标变更应版本化，恢复时先核对结果未知的操作。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-19",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 19,
      "label": "Agent评估",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/19_evaluation.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-012"
      ],
      "insight": "工具选择、轨迹约束和最终状态分别测；多条正确路径不宜逐字匹配，严重越权不能被平均分掩盖。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-20",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 20,
      "label": "循环稳定性",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/20_loop_stability.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-013"
      ],
      "insight": "重复调用是告警信号，关键是目标状态是否有进展；给重试分类、时间预算与退出条件，避免把合理轮询误判死循环。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-21",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 21,
      "label": "链路延迟",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/21_agent_latency_trace.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-024"
      ],
      "insight": "同时观察首字延迟、完成时间和尾延迟；定位并行工作中的关键路径，不把所有span耗时直接相加。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-22",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 22,
      "label": "失联与并发写",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/22_multi_agent_resilience.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-033"
      ],
      "insight": "失联不等于进程已停止；接管需要版本或fencing token防旧执行者继续提交，文件改动要隔离并集成验证。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-23",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 23,
      "label": "完成声明",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/23_task_hallucination.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-058"
      ],
      "insight": "区分计划、已受理、已执行与已验证；完成报告绑定任务版本、产物和核对证据，结果未知应明确说明。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-AGENT-24",
      "group": "agent",
      "order": 24,
      "label": "数据库访问",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/agent/24_database_security.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-017"
      ],
      "insight": "只读身份、参数绑定、结构检查和对象权限守住执行边界；查询安全不保证指标口径正确，结果还需业务核验。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-01",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 1,
      "label": "RAG流程",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/1_whatisrag.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-001"
      ],
      "insight": "区分离线索引与在线问答：解析、切分、索引之后，在线先授权检索，再组装证据和生成，最后校验引用及边界。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-02",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 2,
      "label": "RAG能力边界",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/2_rag_problems.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-001"
      ],
      "insight": "外部知识可改善更新和可追溯性，但接入知识库不能保证召回、证据使用或事实本身正确。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-03",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 3,
      "label": "RAG与微调",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/3_rag_vs_finetune.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AD-001"
      ],
      "insight": "事实更新、引用和权限往往优先考虑检索；行为适配可考虑训练。两者可组合，不是知识与行为的绝对分界。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-04",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 4,
      "label": "切分与存储",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/4_chunking.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-002"
      ],
      "insight": "块内容之外保留父文档、标题、版本、页段和权限；长度与overlap依据文档结构和评测选择，不背固定最优数值。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-05",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 5,
      "label": "语义边界",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/5_semantic_cuts.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-023"
      ],
      "insight": "先识别段落、表格、代码和标题边界，再通过父子块或邻块补上下文；补得越多也可能带来噪声和成本。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-06",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 6,
      "label": "Embedding选型",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/6_embedding.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-051"
      ],
      "insight": "在本业务语言、任务和权限条件下比较召回、延迟与成本；排行榜只能筛候选，不能替代本地标注集。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-07",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 7,
      "label": "向量表示",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/7_embedding_algos.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-003"
      ],
      "insight": "词向量、上下文编码和句向量的训练目标不同；向量接近是模型学到的表示关系，不是逻辑真值证明。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-08",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 8,
      "label": "向量数据库",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/8_vectordb.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-008"
      ],
      "insight": "比较召回质量、更新一致性、过滤能力、备份和运维，而不仅是ANN算法名称或单次延迟。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-09",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 9,
      "label": "容量与性能口径",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/9_vectordb_practice.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-008"
      ],
      "insight": "描述数据量时给出向量数、维度、索引和过滤条件；报告并发、召回目标及p95，不借用他人项目规模当经历。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-10",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 10,
      "label": "在线链路",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/10_online_workflow.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-001"
      ],
      "insight": "查询改写、检索、重排、上下文选择和生成是不同阶段；保留每阶段输入输出，才能定位答案错在哪里。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-11",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 11,
      "label": "稀疏与稠密检索",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/11_retrieval_types.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-006"
      ],
      "insight": "关键词对编号、术语和精确匹配有价值，稠密检索更擅长语义联系；混合效果由数据与融合评测决定。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-12",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 12,
      "label": "查询改写",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/12_query_rewrite.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-007"
      ],
      "insight": "补全会话指代与表达方式，但保留实体、时间和业务约束；改写错意图可能比不改更差。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-13",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 13,
      "label": "多路融合",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/13_multi_retrieval.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-040"
      ],
      "insight": "RRF使用排名而非原始分数尺度，平滑常数不是召回K；融合分数不是概率，仍需去重和检查各路噪声。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-14",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 14,
      "label": "分阶段优化",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/14_retrieval_opt.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-020"
      ],
      "insight": "先区分未召回、证据选择错误和生成不遵循，再针对瓶颈改变一个环节；堆叠组件不等于质量提升。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-15",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 15,
      "label": "复杂RAG",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/15_advanced_paradigms.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-013"
      ],
      "insight": "多跳、纠错检索、图检索和自检索面向不同失败模式；新增步骤需有收益证据与停止预算。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-16",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 16,
      "label": "图检索适用性",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/16_graph_db.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-044"
      ],
      "insight": "显式关系、跨实体路径和全局归纳可能受益于图；实体抽取、关系更新和错误传播也是成本。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-17",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 17,
      "label": "引用与幻觉",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/17_hallucination.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-011"
      ],
      "insight": "引用存在不等于片段支持主张；逐条核对回答、证据和适用范围，并为不足证据提供部分回答或拒答。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-18",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 18,
      "label": "评测分工",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/18_evaluation.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-029",
        "RG-009"
      ],
      "insight": "Context Recall关注参考信息覆盖，Precision关注相关内容排序，Faithfulness关注上下文支持；它们不能统称准确率。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-19",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 19,
      "label": "持续更新",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/19_dynamic_update.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-014"
      ],
      "insight": "版本、失效、删除与权限变化都应传播到索引、缓存和引用；切换期间要避免混用不一致版本。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-20",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 20,
      "label": "落地难点",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/20_hardest_parts.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-004"
      ],
      "insight": "从真实错误样本定位输入文档、检索、生成和权限中的主因；项目经历与量化收益只使用自己验证过的数据。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-RAG-21",
      "group": "rag",
      "order": 21,
      "label": "知识冲突",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/rag/21_knowledge_conflict.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "RG-071"
      ],
      "insight": "比较版本、生效范围和权威规则；相似度高或发布时间新不必然更可信，无法裁决时保留分歧和待核实项。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-TOOLS-01",
      "group": "tools",
      "order": 1,
      "label": "工具调用闭环",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/tools/1_function_calling.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-002"
      ],
      "insight": "模型返回调用名称与参数，宿主校验并执行后回传工具结果；调用意图、函数返回和业务完成要分别确认。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-TOOLS-02",
      "group": "tools",
      "order": 2,
      "label": "工具学习",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/tools/2_llm_tool_learning.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "LP-046"
      ],
      "insight": "工具能力包括何时调用、选哪个、参数与结果利用；训练路线依模型而异，不能推断所有模型必经相同阶段。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-TOOLS-03",
      "group": "tools",
      "order": 3,
      "label": "工具训练评测",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/tools/3_fc_training.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "LP-046"
      ],
      "insight": "训练样本需覆盖不调用、失败和多轮场景；应用侧仍需要描述、校验、权限和轨迹回归，训练不会替代运行时责任。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-TOOLS-04",
      "group": "tools",
      "order": 4,
      "label": "MCP定位",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/tools/4_what_is_mcp.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-004",
        "AG-019"
      ],
      "insight": "MCP规范连接与能力交换，宿主决定如何适配模型；原生Function Calling是常见方式，不是协议的必要前提。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-TOOLS-05",
      "group": "tools",
      "order": 5,
      "label": "MCP架构",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/tools/5_mcp_components.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-018"
      ],
      "insight": "区分Host、Client、Server与底层传输；生命周期等细节按协议版本讲，不能把新旧握手拼成一套。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-TOOLS-06",
      "group": "tools",
      "order": 6,
      "label": "FC与MCP",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/tools/6_mcp_vs_fc.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-004"
      ],
      "insight": "模型调用表达和服务接入协议处于不同层；程序直接调用MCP也可成立，但模型是否可靠选择工具需单独验证。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-TOOLS-07",
      "group": "tools",
      "order": 7,
      "label": "接入选择",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/tools/7_fc_vs_mcp_usage.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-018"
      ],
      "insight": "根据复用、部署、授权和维护成本选本地函数、API或MCP；协议接通不等于参数和能力无损适配。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-TOOLS-08",
      "group": "tools",
      "order": 8,
      "label": "兼容问题定位",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/tools/8_reasoning_no_mcp.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-018"
      ],
      "insight": "逐层核查模型接口、宿主适配器、工具schema和协议版本；不要从单个产品限制推出推理与工具调用不兼容。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-TOOLS-09",
      "group": "tools",
      "order": 9,
      "label": "Agent Skills",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/tools/9_skill.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-059"
      ],
      "insight": "技能包提供任务知识、步骤及可选脚本资源；它不自动授予执行权限，也不要求所有工具都经MCP。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-TOOLS-10",
      "group": "tools",
      "order": 10,
      "label": "Skill与MCP",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/tools/10_mcp_vs_skill.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-059"
      ],
      "insight": "一个侧重可复用任务知识，一个侧重能力接入；可以组合，也可分别配合原生工具和普通程序使用。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-TOOLS-11",
      "group": "tools",
      "order": 11,
      "label": "三种机制",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/tools/11_fc_skill_mcp.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-059"
      ],
      "insight": "区分调用表达、能力协议和知识包；不存在缺一不可的FC→MCP→Skill强制链。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-TOOLS-12",
      "group": "tools",
      "order": 12,
      "label": "A2A协作",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/tools/12_a2a_protocol.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-060"
      ],
      "insight": "A2A关注远端Agent能力与任务协作；其AgentSkill是能力描述，不是包含SKILL.md的目录包。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-TOOLS-13",
      "group": "tools",
      "order": 13,
      "label": "MCP传输",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/tools/13_mcp_transport.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-011"
      ],
      "insight": "2025-11-25示例使用stdio或Streamable HTTP；SSE是可能的响应载体，旧HTTP+SSE传输演进不等于SSE格式消失。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-TOOLS-14",
      "group": "tools",
      "order": 14,
      "label": "事件流与双向连接",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/tools/14_sse_vs_websocket.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "LP-005"
      ],
      "insight": "SSE、浏览器EventSource与WebSocket不是同一层概念；POST可以返回SSE格式，重连与取消仍需应用协议。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-TOOLS-15",
      "group": "tools",
      "order": 15,
      "label": "实时媒体",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/tools/15_webrtc_vs_ws.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "LP-047"
      ],
      "insight": "WebRTC处理实时媒体和连接协商，WebSocket处理可靠双向消息；选型看迟到数据、编解码、网络和控制流，不背固定延迟倍数。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-TOOLS-16",
      "group": "tools",
      "order": 16,
      "label": "模型网关",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/tools/16_llm_gateway.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "EN-014"
      ],
      "insight": "网关统一入口、密钥治理、路由、预算与观测；兼容端点不保证模型能力无损切换，语义缓存也必须保持权限与版本边界。 Maxim的Bifrost网关核心使用Go，提供HTTP网关与Go SDK；选型仍需按固定版本验证接口兼容、失败回退、权限和真实负载性能，不能从实现语言推断任何场景都更快。",
      "primary_urls": [
        "https://github.com/maximhq/bifrost/blob/0ebea6091a4005f72b346923da28412268ce9325/core/go.mod",
        "https://github.com/maximhq/bifrost/blob/0ebea6091a4005f72b346923da28412268ce9325/core/bifrost.go"
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-TOOLS-17",
      "group": "tools",
      "order": 17,
      "label": "工具路由",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/tools/17_tool_routing.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-061"
      ],
      "insight": "私有工具先按可信身份约束候选，再检索相关能力，执行前重新校验资源与动作权限；候选过滤不能代替最终授权。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-TOOLS-18",
      "group": "tools",
      "order": 18,
      "label": "工具故障",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/tools/18_tool_reliability.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-014"
      ],
      "insight": "格式错、业务拒绝、临时故障、超时且结果未知需分别处理；写操作重试前核对幂等键和实际副作用状态。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-01",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 1,
      "label": "模型与NLP分类",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/what_is_llm.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "FD-025"
      ],
      "insight": "生成与判别、传统与现代是不同分类轴；LLM没有统一的百亿参数门槛，不能把传统NLP全部说成判别式。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-02",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 2,
      "label": "Transformer结构",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/transformer_architecture.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "FD-016"
      ],
      "insight": "Encoder、Decoder及交叉注意力服务不同信息流；按掩码和输入输出任务区分，不以名称推断万能能力。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-03",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 3,
      "label": "注意力优化层次",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/mha_mqa_gqa_flash_attention.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "FD-007"
      ],
      "insight": "MQA/GQA改变KV共享结构，FlashAttention减少显存访问与中间矩阵物化；MLA又是不同表示设计，不能互相替代概念。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-04",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 4,
      "label": "位置信息",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/position_encoding.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "FD-009"
      ],
      "insight": "位置编码提供序列次序关系；RoPE、绝对位置与ALiBi的形式不同，外推表现需结合训练长度和模型实测。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-05",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 5,
      "label": "分词",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/tokenizer.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "FD-005"
      ],
      "insight": "token不是固定一个字或一个词；词表、编码规则和语言分布影响长度，字符计数与数学推理仍需单独验证。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-06",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 6,
      "label": "训练配方",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/llm_training.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "FD-013"
      ],
      "insight": "预训练与后训练职责不同，SFT属于后训练；具体路线可以交错迭代，不是所有模型必经固定三段。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-07",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 7,
      "label": "缩放与涌现",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/scaling_law_emergence.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "FD-014",
        "FD-017",
        "FD-024"
      ],
      "insight": "缩放律拟合特定设置下的损失趋势，不能直接换算业务能力比例；阈值现象也可能受到指标离散化影响。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-08",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 8,
      "label": "微调路线",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/finetuning.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AD-001",
        "AD-005"
      ],
      "insight": "全参、适配器与量化训练的选择取决于任务数据、预算和部署；改善行为不代表所有事实更新都适合写进权重。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-09",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 9,
      "label": "LoRA形状",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/lora.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AD-004",
        "AD-001"
      ],
      "insight": "先给W、A、B的维度再写乘法；低秩约束的是更新矩阵，秩和目标层要通过验证集选择。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-10",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 10,
      "label": "后训练范围",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/post_training.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "FD-013",
        "AD-008"
      ],
      "insight": "SFT、偏好优化、奖励优化和拒绝采样是可组合手段；不要把post-training定义为排除SFT的单一步骤。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-11",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 11,
      "label": "DPO与PPO",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/dpo_vs_ppo.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AD-003",
        "AD-008"
      ],
      "insight": "DPO优化相对参考策略的成对偏好，PPO是策略优化方法；偏好数据来源与优化算法应分开讨论。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-12",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 12,
      "label": "解码策略",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/decoding_strategies.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "FD-012"
      ],
      "insight": "有限宽度beam是近似剪枝搜索，不保证全空间最优；它可共享前缀KV，成本取决于实现和搜索宽度。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-13",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 13,
      "label": "采样配置",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/temperature_top_p_top_k.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "LP-001"
      ],
      "insight": "温度、Top-P和Top-K可联合存在，具体支持和推荐依模型而异；不存在所有任务统一最佳设置，T=0也不保证服务逐位可复现。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-14",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 14,
      "label": "缓存两本账",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/kv_cache_prompt_caching.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "FD-026",
        "EN-001"
      ],
      "insight": "区分同次解码KV与跨请求前缀复用；按KV头数计算理想容量，缓存命中减少重复prefill，不等于减少所有生成计算。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-15",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 15,
      "label": "量化比较",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/quantization.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AD-002"
      ],
      "insight": "位宽、量化算法、存储格式和执行内核分别比较；GPTQ、AWQ、NF4不是同一条高低精度阶梯，低位宽不保证固定加速。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-16",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 16,
      "label": "提示设计",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/prompt_engineering.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "LP-006"
      ],
      "insight": "明确任务、证据、约束、输出契约与例子，并用回归样本验证；角色描述和要求JSON不能替代事实及schema检查。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-17",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 17,
      "label": "CoT边界",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/cot.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "LP-018"
      ],
      "insight": "中间步骤可以帮助部分任务，但也会增加成本或传播错误；可见推理文字不自动构成可靠证据。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-18",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 18,
      "label": "幻觉处理",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/hallucination.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "FD-002"
      ],
      "insight": "区分证据缺失、证据使用失败与事实错误；拒答、校验、检索和评估配合，不能保证一个提示词消灭幻觉。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-19",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 19,
      "label": "MoE成本",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/moe.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "FD-010"
      ],
      "insight": "总参数与每token激活参数是不同账；路由、负载、访存和通信影响延迟，激活37B不等于某个37B稠密模型的实测速度。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-20",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 20,
      "label": "推理引擎能力",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/deployment_frameworks.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AD-024",
        "AD-014",
        "AD-011"
      ],
      "insight": "模型、硬件、功能和维护状态需按版本核查；vLLM有前缀缓存，TGI处于维护模式，接口兼容也要做行为回归。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-21",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 21,
      "label": "能力评估",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/evaluation_metrics.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "FD-020"
      ],
      "insight": "基准、指标、业务测试集与线上信号分开；排查污染、任务分布和评审偏差，不从榜单单分推出全部应用效果。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-22",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 22,
      "label": "模型选择",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/model_selection.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "LP-008"
      ],
      "insight": "以业务成功、延迟、费用及数据约束评估候选；他人的厂商偏好、离线成绩或项目规模不能当自己的选型证据。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LLM-23",
      "group": "llm",
      "order": 23,
      "label": "有效上下文",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/llm/23_long_context_lost_middle.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "FD-028"
      ],
      "insight": "标称窗口不等于任务有效长度；改变证据位置、干扰和问题复杂度做对照，再决定裁剪、检索或分层处理。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LANGCHAIN-01",
      "group": "langchain",
      "order": 1,
      "label": "框架选型",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/langchain/agent_frameworks.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "AG-010"
      ],
      "insight": "LangChain Agent建立在LangGraph之上，LlamaIndex也包含Agent与工作流能力；按控制需求和维护责任选，不作二选一口号。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LANGCHAIN-02",
      "group": "langchain",
      "order": 2,
      "label": "Runnable与LCEL",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/langchain/chain.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "LC-001"
      ],
      "insight": "组合接口与底层执行实现分开；ainvoke可能包装同步invoke，stream也不保证每个组件逐token输出。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LANGCHAIN-03",
      "group": "langchain",
      "order": 3,
      "label": "架构分工",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/langchain/langchain_architecture.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "LC-001"
      ],
      "insight": "核心抽象、供应商集成、高层Agent和状态编排职责不同；普通函数也可作为图节点，不要求每次都穿过固定层级。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LANGCHAIN-04",
      "group": "langchain",
      "order": 4,
      "label": "创建Agent",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/langchain/build_agent.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "LC-002"
      ],
      "insight": "create_agent把模型、工具和策略组合成标准循环；权限、业务错误、预算和副作用仍由应用明确设计。"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "XL-LANGCHAIN-05",
      "group": "langchain",
      "order": 5,
      "label": "注册工具",
      "url": "https://xiaolinnote.com/ai/langchain/tool_registration.html",
      "target_ids": [
        "LC-002"
      ],
      "insight": "装饰器与schema描述可调用能力，bind_tools不等于已执行工具；身份和授权应来自可信运行上下文。"
    },
